Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.33,0:00:04.62,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Fight, crash through, and face the challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.62,0:00:07.84,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,These are our hard knock days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:12.67,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Can't quench our thirst with a peaceful, everyday life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.67,0:00:15.18,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Here we go - don't ever run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:19.22,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Let's go on living as the mighty winds take us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.22,0:00:21.73,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,We've still got so far to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.73,0:00:26.23,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep going through the hard knock days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:31.45,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again, yes, baby.  How many times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.45,0:00:33.95,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,do I have to stand back up to make my dream come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.95,0:00:36.57,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Feels like the strength of my resolve
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.57,0:00:39.04,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,is put to the test everyday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:40.54,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.54,0:00:44.29,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,I don't want to make excuses and settle for being mediocre. {Starfish made this lovely suggestion. But feel free to change this back in the interest of consistency, if that's more important. -Jules  Original: I don't want to settle for small victories or make excuses.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.29,0:00:45.80,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:49.51,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,We leapt into a crazy, lawless world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.51,0:00:54.01,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,As I struggled for a foothold, reality caught me off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.01,0:00:59.31,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Even if it beats me, hits me, knocks me down again,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.31,0:01:00.06,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.06,0:01:04.40,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Only when we get back on our feet and look forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.40,0:01:07.44,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,will we have the last laugh, be the winners!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:09.96,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,We gotta go down this glory road, till we reach our goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:12.56,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Fight, shake it off, act strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.56,0:01:15.56,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,These are our hard knock days.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:20.57,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,There's no such thing as a safe choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.57,0:01:22.90,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Here we go - we'll always be the strongest!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.90,0:01:27.16,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Let's keep moving - never mind the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:29.74,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,Let's put our wishes all together,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.74,0:01:34.75,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,and keep on going through the hard knock days.
